      "comments": "Export grid bounds in meters and original grain IDs. The ROI has 37 observed grain IDs with gaps up to 935. Names Phase_<id> are generated format labels for these grains, not 935 observed grains or physical phases. This file has no constitutive model or orientation-to-material-axis assignment.",
