        "parameters_version": 1
      },
      "comments": "Remove the temporary full input and the inherited Grain Data table after export. Its sizes and boundary flags describe the full predecessor, not this ROI. Retain cropped cell arrays, phase metadata, measured millimeter placement, and the local meter grid. The predecessor file is unchanged.",
